  "remarks": "JSC Bank Orenburg is a regional commercial bank headquartered in the Orenburg region of the Russian Federation. It is active in the pilot project for operations with real digital roubles launched by the Central Bank of Russia. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, JSC Bank Orenburg is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
